{
  "id": "EZK.42",
  "number": "42",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekiel 42",
  "verseCount": 16,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "42",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 42"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "42",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the man took me into the outer courtyard and led me to a building on the north side of the Temple, not far from the building at the west end of the Temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This building was fifty metres long and 25 metres wide. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On one side it faced the space ten metres wide which was alongside the Temple, and on the other side it faced the pavement of the outer court. It was built on three levels, each one set further back than the one below it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Along the north side of this building was a passage five metres wide and fifty metres long,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some ancient translations",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "fifty metres long",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "a way of fifty centimetres.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with entrances on that side. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rooms at the upper level of the building were narrower than those at the middle and lower levels because they were set further back. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rooms at all three levels were on terraces and were not supported by columns like the other buildings in the courtyard. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the lower level the outer wall of the building was solid for 25 metres, half its length; and there were rooms in the remaining 25 metres. At the top level there were rooms in the entire length of the building. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.7+EZK.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.7",
              "EZK.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Below these two rooms at the east end of the building, where the wall of the courtyard began,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.9–10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "where",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "…",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "began",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "in the breadth of the wall of the courtyard.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " there was an entrance into the outer courtyard.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At the south",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.9–10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "One ancient translation",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "south",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "; Hebrew",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "east.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " side of the Temple there was an identical building not far from the building at the west end of the Temple. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.9+EZK.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.9",
              "EZK.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In front of the rooms there was a passage just like the one on the north side. It had the same measurements, the same design, and the same kind of entrances. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There was a door under the rooms on the south side of the building, at the east end where the wall began.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The man said to me, “Both these buildings are holy. In them the priests who enter the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "'s presence eat the holiest offerings. Because the rooms are holy, the priests will place the holiest offerings there: the grain offerings and the sacrifices offered for sin or as repayment offerings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When priests have been in the Temple and want to go to the outer courtyard, they must leave in these rooms the holy clothing they wore while serving the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". They must put on other clothes before going out to the area where the people gather.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the man had finished measuring inside the temple area, he took me out through the east gate and then measured the outside of the area. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He took the measuring rod and measured the east side, and it was 250 metres. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he measured the north side, the south side, and the west side; each side had the same length, 250 metres,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17",
              "EZK.42.18",
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42.17–19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Verses 16–19 in Hebrew are unclear.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.17+EZK.42.18+EZK.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.17",
              "EZK.42.18",
              "EZK.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that the wall enclosed a square 250 metres on each side. The wall served to separate what was holy from what was not.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.42.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
